> \begin{defi}[BTZ topology] Let $\Delta$ be a lightlike line in $\mass{}$. The BTZ topology on
> $J^+(\Delta)$ is the topology generated by the one induced by the natural topology of $\mass{}$
> and open subsets of the form $I^+(p)\cup]p,+\infty[$ for $p\in \Delta$ where $]p,+\infty[$ denote
